# Protocol — Dataset / inputs ({{CAMPAIGN_TITLE}})

[[OPTIONAL — DELETE this whole file for a fixed-real-dataset campaign that only consumes existing data.
For such a campaign, keep just this note: "Inputs are the fixed experimental data at {{DATA_SOURCE}};
